		{
			description: [
				"The world in Mine Piece is divided into five major seas: East Blue, North Blue, Grand Line, New World, and the mighty Red Line that separates them all."
				"Early in your journey, you'll receive special compasses pointing toward each of these seas. Use the East Blue Compass to find your way to calmer waters, perfect for beginners looking to grow stronger."
				"Every sea holds unique enemies, challenges, and treasures. Start by visiting the East Blue, a classic entry point into this vast ocean world."
			]
